Chapter: NvGspSysInfoTest
  cites Kernel chapter NvGspSysInfo
  cites Foreword chapter Format

 The expected output is tinygrad's own rpc_set_gsp_system_info, run by
 Python against a stub PCI device: build/nv-gsp-sysinfo-oracle.ps1.

Section: Main

  hex-bytes : List Integer, Integer, Text -> Text
  hex-bytes (bs) (i) (acc) = if i >= list-length bs then acc else hex-bytes bs (i + 1) (acc & fmt-hex-pad (list-at bs i) 2)

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
   print-line-uni ("S 0 " & hex-bytes (nv-gsp-system-info #F6000000 #6000000000 #6800000000 1 0 0 #280310DE #88971043 #A1 False) 0 "")
   print-line-uni ("S 1 " & hex-bytes (nv-gsp-system-info #DE000000 #C000000000 #C200000000 #41 #1F 7 #13C210DE #3101462 2 True) 0 "")
  end
